         <h1 id="Monitoring_Container_Workloads_Using_Amazon_Managed_Service_for_Prometheus_with_Wiz_.7C_Case_Study_.7C_AWS" class="lb-txt-normal lb-txt-none lb-h1 lb-title">Monitoring Container Workloads Using Amazon Managed Service for Prometheus with Wiz | Case Study | AWS</h1>
         <div class="lb-rtxt">
          <p>Wiz uses Amazon Managed Service for Prometheus to monitor its infrastructure.<br></p>
         </div>
         <div class="lb-rtxt">
          <p><b><a href="#Overview">Overview</a> </b>|<b> <a href="#Opportunity">Opportunity</a> </b>|<b> <a href="#Solution">Solution</a> </b>|<b> <a href="#Outcome">Outcome</a> </b>|<b> <a href="#AWS_Services_Used">AWS Services Used</a><b> </b></b></p>
